    "## 4. 关键错误调整点汇总\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 过滤条件写法错误\n",
    "- `data[ data['SensorType'].isin(['Temperature','Humidity']) ]` 是温湿度过滤的正确写法\n",
    "- 曾错写为 `data['SensorType']['Temperature','Humidity']` 或把 `groupby(...)` 直接嵌进过滤表达式\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.2 对象/模块调用错误\n",
    "- `data = pd.dropna()` 是错误的调用方式；正确方式是 `data = data.dropna()`\n",
    "- `cleaned_data = data(data=['is_abnormal'])` 错误；应使用 `data.drop(columns=['is_abnormal'])`\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.3 拼写错误\n",
    "- `data['Age'].bewteen(...)` → `between`\n",
    "- `fillna(methos='ffill')` → `method`\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.4 参数传递写法不规范\n",
    "- `agg('count','mean')` → `agg(['count', 'mean'])` 或 `agg({'count', 'mean'})`\n",
    "- `fillna('bfill')` → `fillna(method='bfill')`\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.5 逻辑运算符错误\n",
    "- Pandas 中应使用 `|` 而不是 `||`\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.6 属性或方法名误用\n",
    "- `data.length` / `data.length()` → `len(data)`\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.7 2026-08-01 新增错误记录\n",
    "- **1.1.2 第二次练习（16:59）**：\n",
    "  - `fillna('bfill', inplace=True)` → 缺少 `method=` 关键字\n",
    "  - `data(data=['is_abnormal'])` → DataFrame 不是函数，应使用 `drop()`\n",
    "- **1.1.2 第三次练习（17:16）**：\n",
    "  - `fillna(methos='ffill')` → 拼写错误，应为 `method`\n",
    "  - 最终修正后全部正确 ✅"
   ]
